1
00:00:00,691 --> 00:00:01,961
(Howard:)You're in a good mood.

2
00:00:01,959 --> 00:00:04,659
(Sheldon:)Well, it's a new day.
I have a new outlook.

3
00:00:04,661 --> 00:00:06,791
(Sheldon:)You know, I realized
I don't need to worry

4
00:00:06,797 --> 00:00:08,067
(Sheldon:)about other people.

5
00:00:08,065 --> 00:00:11,535
(Sheldon:)I just need to think
more about myself.

6
00:00:14,071 --> 00:00:18,011
(Leonard:)Oh, how will we ever
get used to the new you?

7
00:00:18,942 --> 00:00:21,242
(Raj:)Well, I'm glad to
see you moving forward.

8
00:00:21,245 --> 00:00:22,915
(Sheldon:)Bert did quality
research.

9
00:00:22,913 --> 00:00:26,113
(Sheldon:)And he deserves whatever
accolades he receives.

10
00:00:26,116 --> 00:00:27,986
(Howard:)What is going on?

11
00:00:27,985 --> 00:00:30,385
(Howard:)Did you upgrade
his software last night?

12
00:00:31,421 --> 00:00:33,251
(Leonard:)I think he might be
learning on his own.

13
00:00:33,257 --> 00:00:36,087
(Raj:)Then the robot uprising
has begun.

14
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:39,458
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, I need to pay Bert

15
00:00:39,463 --> 00:00:42,293
(Sheldon:)a proper congratulations.

16
00:00:44,868 --> 00:00:46,938
(Raj:)He doesn't just look
like C-3PO,

17
00:00:46,937 --> 00:00:48,607
(Raj:)now he walks like him.

18
00:00:49,873 --> 00:00:51,043
(Sheldon:)Bert?

19
00:00:51,041 --> 00:00:54,171
(Sheldon:)I wanted to let you know
that I read your research,

20
00:00:54,177 --> 00:00:57,177
(Sheldon:)and your award is
well-deserved.

21
00:00:57,180 --> 00:01:00,280
(Bert:)Thanks. I've been
hearing that a lot.

